    # Which region? Let me map special position to fill region
    # TL special (0<=sr<3, 0<=sc<3) → fill BR
    # TR special (0<=sr<3, 3<=sc<7) → fill BL
    # BL special (3<=sr<7, 0<=sc<3) → fill TR
    # BR special (3<=sr<7, 3<=sc<7) → fill TL

